<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2PE" style="id">— Iyaa (YAK) NT en Kiyaka</book>
  <para style="h">2 Peetero</para>
  <para style="toc3">2Pe</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Peetero</para>
  <para style="toc1">Mukaanda wa mioolo wa Peetero</para>
  <para style="mt2">Mukaanda wa mioolo wa</para>
  <para style="mt1">Peetero</para>
  <para style="imt">Kotili</para>
  <para style="ip">Mukaanda wu basonuu nde kwaa bangaa Kristo boosi. Musonii li mu uha mabweele, mundaa ti taanga dia likwa la nde dika bebele (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2PE 1:13">1.13</ref></char>). Nde li mu usonuu paa ti bangaa imiini balibili moonyi mu nziisili a nde.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mukaanda wu li mu uloombo kwaa bo, mu ukebe <char style="em">bifu bibibwe</char> bili mu umata mu <char style="em">imiini kia bo</char> na uba ba <char style="em">bakangama mu nziisili</char> yi bo bayaki (kiiti kia tsiomi <char style="xt"><ref loc="2PE 1">1</ref></char>). Nde li mu udwaanisa bayiisi ba pia, bali mu uyiisi pia na bali na ndiaatili ya butsa-butsa (kiiti kia bioolo <char style="xt"><ref loc="2PE 2">2</ref></char>). Tumake, mukaanda wu li mu utsuu mu iluumbu ki Pfumu Yiisu akaayiri (kiiti kia bitata <char style="xt"><ref loc="2PE 3">3</ref></char>). Bangaa Kristo ba isieende kiatsiomi bakwiiri, ka Yiisu a ayiri avutuu pe. Baata balaa mitimi mia bo miaviinzii, na a bali mu ubahala pe udiingi kwa nziriri a nde. Ka bu bangaa imiini bakikebe nde, <char style="em">Nziaambi amweesi kamini a mutimi a nde kwaa bangooyi</char>. Nde li mu uha kuulu kwaa baata boosi, mu usobo ndiaatili a bo.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mu ndaa uhamisa imiini kia bo, bangaa Kristo bakisalila ka mandaa masonii mibili mia Lilasina lilikulu. Bo bali ka na nziisili yi bo bayaki kwaa bambaangi ba Yiisu Kristo (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2PE 3:2">3.2</ref></char>). Mu taanga di basonii mukaanda a Peetero wa mioolo, mikaanda mia Pawuli mimimosi miakwiyabina (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2PE 3:15">3.15</ref></char>). A bwafwaana pe mu usaa ubahala so ubiindili Mabasonuu mu iwe makulu (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2PE 1:20">1.20</ref></char>), kwahele a utsimi (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2PE 3:16">3.16</ref></char>). Libaasila la bangaa Kristo babamosi na la Muheebili wa Ngira, lili na ndutu mu uyiluu ubahala Mabasonuu ma Ngira.</para>
  <para style="ie" />
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2PE 1" />
  <para style="s1">Mabwee</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2PE 1:1" />Me tumu a Yiisu Simoni Peetero, musiali na tumu a Yiisu Kristo, ndi mu usonuu mukaanda wu. Me tsindii nde kwaa babali mu usa imiini mu Yiisu Kristo, weti bu bisi ka diasa imiini mu nde, mundaa libweeye la Nziaambi a bisi na la Muyobili bisi Yiisu Kristo. <verse eid="2PE 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2PE 1:2" />Nyaala bweese na iyeenge bia Nziaambi bifwaabila kwaa beni, mundaa ti, beni diayiluu uyaaba nde na Pfumu a bisi Yiisu Kristo!<verse eid="2PE 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nziaambi ata bisi mbili na asoolo bisi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2PE 1:3" />Mu lituu la yula, Nziaambi aha bisi bungori boosi ba dili na nzala bo mu idiingi, mu uba babanambita mu nde. Nde makulu amweesi bisi muutu wuu wa ta bisi mbili, mundaa uba buzitu ba nde mu amonii kwaa bisi, na mu mifuri mia nde makulu. <verse eid="2PE 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2PE 1:4" />Ni mu kuulu a buzitu na bunene baa, nde akuusi ndasini di nde asi bisi, mu uha bisi biloo biavulu tala. Ni mundaa a bungori baa, beni dibaa moonyi wa inziaambi, na uhele uba itwaari na manzala ma tsi.<verse eid="2PE 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2PE 1:5" />Ni mu buu, disa mifuri mu uyelese imiini kia beni mu ndiaatili yimbwe, na nziaabili a Nziaambi. <verse eid="2PE 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2PE 1:6" />Nha yulu a nziaabili a Nziaambi, dibweese kamini a mutimi. Nha yulu a kamini a mutimi, dibweese mukonono. Na nha yulu a mukonono, nha yulu nhaa dinambita mu Nziaambi. <verse eid="2PE 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2PE 1:7" />Nha yulu a unambita mu Nziaambi, dibweese litoono mu bambaayi. Tumake, nha yulu a litoono mu bambaayi, dibweese litoono mu baata boosi. <verse eid="2PE 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2PE 1:8" />Ninha, mbiiti beni dili na biyiluu bibibwe bii, na mbiiti beni diyelisi bio, bio sa bibiti beni mu uhele uba babolo, na sa bikulusu beni mu nziaabili a Pfumu a bisi Yiisu Kristo. <verse eid="2PE 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2PE 1:9" />Ka muutu wahele na biyiluu bii, afwaanina na ingima-ngimi, mundaa ti nde a ali mu umono pe bubwe. Nde li mu udiimbili ti, Nziaambi atsieemese nde mu masumu ma nde ma makulu.<verse eid="2PE 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2PE 1:10" />Ni mu buu, baana ba nguu ba me, dibwasa mifuri mu uhamisa mbili yi Nziaambi ati beni, na usoolo ku nde asiooli beni. So beni diyilii buu, beni a dibwiisi imiini kia beni so hoolo pe. <verse eid="2PE 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2PE 1:11" />Ninha, Nziaambi sa adibili beni kwa na haangalaa, ipfumu kia bilimi na bilimi, kia Pfumu na Muyobili a bisi Yiisu Kristo.<verse eid="2PE 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2PE 1:12" />Ni mu buu, me ndi na matsimi ma ubaalibilanga beni mandaa maa, so bu beni diakwayaaba mo, paa beni dinambita mu ngwanya yi beni diayaki. <verse eid="2PE 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2PE 1:13" />Ka me nitsimi ti, bu me keni moonyi mu nyutu ya imuutu yi, me nafwaana ubaalibilanga beni moonyi mu mandaa maa, paa beni diba likanda. <verse eid="2PE 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2PE 1:14" />Ka me nayaaba ti, taanga dia usiisi nyutu ya imuutu yi, dili mu uyiri mawasa-mawasa, weti bu Pfumu a bisi Yiisu Kristo ayaabisi me yo. <verse eid="2PE 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2PE 1:15" />Ni mu buu, so nha mbisi a nziendila me, me sa sa ti, beni dibaalibilanga moonyi taanga dioosi mu mandaa maa moosi.<verse eid="2PE 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mandaa ma mibili mamaayilimi mu Kristo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2PE 1:16" />Ni mu buu, a yili pe mu matsaba ma baata babala mu ubala, bisi diayaabisa kwaa beni nziriri a Pfumu a bisi Yiisu Kristo ya lituu. Ka mu misi mia bisi ba me, diamoni bunene ba nde. <verse eid="2PE 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2PE 1:17" />Nde ayaki kwaa Nziaambi Taayi, likiinzi na buzitu, mu taanga di ndaa ya buzitu yayuyini. Yo yaleeli: «Wuunawu ni Mwaana a me walitoono ndaa. Mu nde me nasuusu kinyi a me yoosi.» <verse eid="2PE 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2PE 1:18" />Bisi bameme diayuyi ndaa yii bu yo yamati ku yula, mu taanga di bisi diali na nde nha yulu a mulaanda wa ngiri<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 17:1-5">Mat 17.1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:2-7">Mlk 9.2-7</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:28-35">Luk 9.28-35</ref></char></note>.<verse eid="2PE 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2PE 1:19" />Ni mu buu, bisi dili na imiini kialaa mu ndaa maleeli mibili. Beni ka diafwaana unambita mu mo. Mo mafwaanina na mwiindi wuli mu ungeyine kutso pimisi, natee bu bwisi bukia, na mbwelele wa ngwaali upala mu uyalisa mitimi mia beni. <verse eid="2PE 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2PE 1:20" />Tswaamina a moosi, diyiluu uyaaba ti, muutu so mosi pe wu utuu ubiindili mu inde makulu, mbilili yili mu Mabasonuu ma Ngira. <verse eid="2PE 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2PE 1:21" />Mundaa ti, a uli na mbilili so mosi pe yi muutu ayaki mu imuutu. Ka Muheebili wa Ngira li mu ubiti baata mu uyaabisa mandaa ma Nziaambi.<verse eid="2PE 1:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2PE 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2PE 2" />
  <para style="s1">Bayiisi ba pia</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="JUD 1:4-13">Yuude 4-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2PE 2:1" />Weti bwali na mibili mia pia nha kati a baata ba Iserali mu tsi kulu, sa uba ka na bayiisi ba pia nha kati a beni. Mu mayele ma peluu, bo sa balooso nziisili yimbi yiyibiti beni ku pfuuyili, na sa batunu Pfumu wa suumbi bo mu uyobolo bo. Mandaa maa sa mabiti bo ku pfuuyili. <verse eid="2PE 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2PE 2:2" />Baata babalayi sa baduku bo mu biyiluu bia bo bia tsoongili. Mu ndaa bo, baata sa batuu kuulu ya ngwanya. <verse eid="2PE 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2PE 2:3" />Mundaa nzala ya ubaa bioosi, bayiisi ba pia baa, sa basalila beni mu kuulu a mandaa ma peluu. Ka umata bele pe, pfuundisi a bo yamaayilimi, na pfuuyili a bo a yabwasaala la pe.<verse eid="2PE 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2PE 2:4" />Ngwanya, Nziaambi a amoni pe ngebe a batumu ba nde babasi masumu. Ka nde wabadumini ku mbuungulu, ku bakutulu bo mikuru kutso pimisi, mu ukebe iluumbu kia pfuundisi. <verse eid="2PE 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2PE 2:5" />Nde a amoni pe ka ngebe dia baata ba tsi kulu. Ka mu taanga di nde ayitili nyaamba nha yulu a tsi yi yaluulu mu baata bangaa masumu, nde avuuyisi Nowa wakiyaabisa mandaa ma libweeye. Nowa avuyi na baata tsaamba bakimi<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 6:1-7">Mba 6.1-7</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 24">24</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 3:20">1Pe 3.20</ref></char></note>. <verse eid="2PE 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2PE 2:6" />Bumosi ka, Nziaambi asieembi baata ba mu mangaanda ma ngaanda a Sodomo na Ngomoro, bu afuuyisi mo mu mbaa. Nde akitisi mo lifutu mu uha ifwaani kia makaabwiilili baata boosi bangaa masumu<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.6 </char><char style="xq" closed="false">masumu </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 19:24">Mba 19.24</ref></char></note>. <verse eid="2PE 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2PE 2:7" />Ka bunu, nde akuulu Loti, muutu walibweeye. Nde akimono pasi mu biyiluu bia bo biatsoongili bia baata ba mu taanga dia nde. Baata baa a bali na likiinzi so hoolo pe mu Nziaambi<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 19:1-16">Mba 19.1-16</ref></char></note>. <verse eid="2PE 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2PE 2:8" />Ngaa libweeye wuu, akidiaala nha kati a bo, akimono na akiyuu moosi ma bo bakiyiluu pasi iluumbu. Na ndiaatili a bo wa hele na Mikele yakiviinzili mutimi a nde wa muutu wa libweeye. <verse eid="2PE 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2PE 2:9" />Ni mu buu, Pfumu li muutu wayaaba buni nde ukuulu mu nziesini, baata babanambata mu nde. Na nde ayaaba ka unyaala bababi paa asieembe bo mu iluumbu kia pfuundisi. <verse eid="2PE 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2PE 2:10" />Nde sa asieembe baata bali mu uduku manzala ma bo makulu ma musunyi, na bali mu utsoro litu la Nziaambi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2PE 2:10">Bayiisi ba pia ba bali na ikaani na liwaa, bo a bali na boomo so hoolo pe mu utuu biyiluu bia buzitu bia ku mayulu. <verse eid="2PE 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2PE 2:11" />Ka bunu, so batumu ba Nziaambi babavulu bo unaanguu mu mifuri na mu lituu, a bubaatuu na uha pfuundisi, mu biyiluu bia buzitu bia ku yulu bi pe, nha kulu a Pfumu.<verse eid="2PE 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2PE 2:12" />Ka bayiisi ba pia ba, bubaayiluu mandaa weti banyama bahele na mayele, babafwaana ti bakaanga na badusu bo. Bo bali mu utuu biyiluu bia buzitu bibahele uyaaba. Nziaambi sa adusu bo, weti bu baata bali mu udusu banyama ba musiti. <verse eid="2PE 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2PE 2:13" />Ni mu buu, bo sa baholo musieende mu moosi mamabi ma bali mu uyiluu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2PE 2:13">Bo bali mu usalila manzala ma bo mamabi nyanga-bala, kwahele a tsionyi. Bo bali mu usumunu na usa saa biloo bia itwaari, mu taanga di bo bali itwaari na beni mu mikuungi. <verse eid="2PE 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2PE 2:14" />Misi mia bo mialuulu mu nzala usoongo. Bo a bubaayutuu pe mu manzala a mandaa mamabi. Baata bangaa imiini ki ikee bubaakoluu mu mieete mia bo. Mitimi mia bo mialuulu mu mwaanzi a mboongo. Bo bali baana ba tsibili. <verse eid="2PE 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2PE 2:15" />Bu bamaasiisi kuulu yasuungunu, na bo bamaadiimbili, mu uduku kuulu yaduki Balaami, mwaana a Bosoro. Nde akitoono mufutu wudibakiha nde, mawasa mawasa mu uyiluu mandaa mamabi. <verse eid="2PE 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2PE 2:16" />Ka Nziaambi asieembi nde mundaa mamabi ma nde ayilii. Mwaana puundi wu ubaahele utsuu, atsuyi weti muutu, na asukisi lari la mubili wu<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 22:4-35">Lit 22.4-35</ref></char></note>.<verse eid="2PE 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2PE 2:17" />Baata ba bafwaanina na bidia bili mu uhele ubwapalisa maamba. Bo bafwaanina na matuti ma piindi ma iteembi ili mu ubingi kwahele a unooso mvulu. Bamaasweehele bo mbuu kutso pimisi dia mvibuu. <verse eid="2PE 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2PE 2:18" />Mu ukuusu manzala ma manyutu ma bo matsoongili, bo bubaatsuu kwalaa, mandaa ma buu a buu. Bo bali mu udiaata buu, paa badiimbisi baata babamaakiingili mayele liaalili. <verse eid="2PE 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2PE 2:19" />Bo bali mu ulasina bo bunyanga. Ka bunu, bo makulu batee ba biyiluu bibibi. Mundaa ti, pasi muutu li mutee a biyiluu bili mu utumu nde. <verse eid="2PE 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2PE 2:20" />Baata babamaakiingili mayele liaalili ba, bamaavuu ku tsini a lituu la mandaa mamabi ma tsi, mundaa ti bo bamaayaaba Pfumu na Muyobili a bisi Yiisu Kristo. Ka so bo babwibwa ku tsini a lituu la mandaa mamabi maa, bo sa bakoto mu pasi diavulu di bo bali na dio tsiomi. <verse eid="2PE 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2PE 2:21" />Mundaa ti, bo bali bayii ndiaatili yimbwe. Ka nha mbisi, bo banyaali ubwatumumu mikele mia ngiri mia Nziaambi mibayiisi bo. Ali yavulu bubwe kwaa bo, mu uhele uyii ndiaatili yasuungunu nha kulu a Nziaambi. <verse eid="2PE 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2PE 2:22" />Miayilimi kwaa bo miafwaanina na tsaba yili mu uleele: « Mbwa maabwayadia biluyi bia nde<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.22 </char><char style="xq" closed="false">nde </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 26:11">Mts 26.11</ref></char></note>.» So a buu pe: «Ngulu nha mbisi a uyobo maamba, maabwavutuu kutso mitamba.»<verse eid="2PE 2:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2PE 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2PE 3" />
  <para style="s1">Lilasina la nziriri a Pfumu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2PE 3:1" />Banduu ba me ba litoono, wuunawu ni mukaanda wa mioolo me ndi mu usonuu kwaa beni. Mu mio miamioolo, me tooni ulibili beni moonyi, mu utsieemese matsimi ma beni mu yatala mandaa ma me naleeli kwaa beni. <verse eid="2PE 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2PE 3:2" />Me natoono ti beni dilibili moonyi mu mandaa makwaleele beni mibili mia Nziaambi mia ngira. Na, a didiimbili pe ka tumini di Pfumu na Muyobili a bisi Yiisu Kristo, ahi kwaa batumu ba nde mu uyaabisa beni.<verse eid="2PE 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2PE 3:3" />Diyiluu ukwayaaba ndaa yi: mu biluumbu bia tsieelele, baata bangaa manzala mamabi na baluulu mu saa, sa bayiri. <verse eid="2PE 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2PE 3:4" />Bo sa baleele mutso saa: «Nde alasini uyiri, a buu pe? Ninha kuni ali? Bakaa ba bisi bakwiiri bele pe! Ka mandaa moosi bu mali, ni buuna bu mali umata mbaandila tsi!» <verse eid="2PE 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2PE 3:5" />Ka, bo bali mu udiimbili mu usaa nhana ti: umata bele pe, Nziaambi ayilii yulu na tsi mu ndaa a nde. Nde akabili toto na maamba na apalisi toto nha kati a maamba. <verse eid="2PE 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2PE 3:6" />Bumosi ka, mu taanga di nyaamba yafuyi toto, tsi yikulu yadiimbili<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.6 </char><char style="xq" closed="false">mu taanga di nyaamba yafuyi toto </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 1:6-9">Mba 1.6-9</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 7:11">7.11</ref></char></note>. <verse eid="2PE 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2PE 3:7" />Mu yatala mayulu na tsi bia lolo bi, ni maana mandaa ma Nziaambi maa, makebe bio mundaa mbaa. Mo makebe bio mundaa iluumbu kia pfuundisi, bu bangaa masumu bakaafuu.<verse eid="2PE 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2PE 3:8" />Ka banduu ba me ba litoono, uli na ndaa mosi yi beni diafwaana uhele udiimbili: Kwaa Pfumu, iluumbu imosi ili weti makama kuumi ma bilimi, na makama kuumi ma bilimi mali weti iluumbu imosi<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 90:4">Mkg 90.4</ref></char></note>. <verse eid="2PE 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2PE 3:9" />Pfumu a ali mu udiingi pe mu ukuusu lilasina la nde, weti bu babamosi bali mu utsimi. Ka mundaa beni nde ali mu ubaakebesele. Mundaa ti, nde a atoono pe ti muutu so ndila mosi afuu. Ka nde atoono ti baata boosi bakiingili mayele.<verse eid="2PE 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2PE 3:10" />Iluumbu kia Pfumu sa iyiri, weti buli mu uyiri muyibi. Mu iluumbu kii, mayulu sa madiimbili mu idumu ki inene. Mbaa sa yinyeengese biloo bioosi bili mu mayulu. Toto na biyiluu bia nde bioosi, sa biyabina mu iluumbu kia pfuundisi. <verse eid="2PE 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2PE 3:11" />Bu yili ti biloo bii bioosi ka sa bidiimbili, beni diafwaana uyiluu uyaaba buni beni diafwaana udiaata! Dinyaala ti ndiaatili a beni yiba ya bungiri, na ya libweeye, na diba bakangama mu Nziaambi. <verse eid="2PE 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2PE 3:12" />Diyiluu ukebe nziriri a iluumbu kia Nziaambi, na disaa ti kio iyiri mu mawasa. Mu iluumbu kii, mayula sa masulumunu mu mbaa, na bioosi bia mu mayulu sa bisulumunu mu kiaangila kia milee mia mbaa<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.12 </char><char style="xq" closed="false">mbaa </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 6-8">Mba 6—8</ref></char></note>.<verse eid="2PE 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2PE 3:13" />Ka bisi dili mu ukebe, weti buli lilasina la nde, mayulu mamanyatii<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.13 </char><char style="xq" closed="false">mamanyatii </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 65:17">Yes 65.17</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 66:22">66.22</ref></char></note> na tsi yinyatii kukaaba libweeye.<verse eid="2PE 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Disa mayele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2PE 3:14" />Ni mu buu, banduu ba me ba litoono, bu dili mu ukebe iluumbu kii, disa mifuri mia beni mioosi mu uba babatsieeme na bahele a keri nha misi mia Nziaambi, na mu uba mu iyeenge na nde. <verse eid="2PE 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2PE 3:15" />Diyaaba ti, ni mundaa liyobolo la beni Pfumu ali mu ubaakama mutimi. Maa ni mandaa matooni uleele Pawuli, mwaana a nguu a bisi wa litoono, bu nde asionii kwaa beni, mu mayele ma Nziaambi aheeri nde. <verse eid="2PE 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2PE 3:16" />Ni buu nde asonuu mu mikaanda mioosi nha nde ali mu utsuu mu mandaa maa. Uli na bitsuru bili na pasi mu ubahala mu mikaanda mii. Na baata bangaa bundimbi na bahele na mayele bali mu utekese mambiindili ma mandaa maa, weti bu bo bali mu utekese mambuu ma mamosi ma Mabasonuu ma Ngira. Ni mu buu, bo bali mu ufuu mu ibomakulu.<verse eid="2PE 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2PE 3:17" />Banduu ba me ba litoono, mu taanga di, me ndi mu udutu beni matswi. Ni mu buu, disa mayele! Dikele a diyadiimbili mu mamabi ma baata babahele na mikele. Na dikele a diyadiimbisi ilimbisi kia beni ki dili na kio. <verse eid="2PE 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2PE 3:18" />Ka dihama mu ukulu mu bweese na mu nziaabili a Pfumu na muvuuyisi a bisi Yiisu Kristo. Kwaa nde buzitu mu taanga di na mu bilimi na bilimi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2PE 3:18">Nyaala buzitu buba kwaa nde, mu taanga di natee mu taanga dikaayira! Ameni.<verse eid="2PE 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2PE 3" />
</usx>